  "description": "*“An instinctive outburst is hard to handle.”*\n\nYeon-Seo, who dreams of becoming a successful internet broadcaster, ventures into the mountains to film a vlog against a winter backdrop. In a remote mountain house, she meets Kim-Ya, a woman with a unique appearance, and feels sympathy for her difficult circumstances. Kim-Ya, trembling with loneliness, and Yeon-Seo, recognizing her unique marketability. The two join forces to start an internet broadcast, but as filming continues, Kim-Ya's inexplicable, strange behavior begins to surface. Yeon-Seo grows curious about Kim-Ya's past and starts uncovering the secrets she holds, one by one.\n\nIn the piercingly cold winter, a terror unlike anything she's ever experienced pierces Yeon-Seo.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
